I found the cause of the unexpectedly long isolated entry run: `--claims SPEC.filter-by-substring` removes the helper circularity from the spec, so it is no longer the candidate’s proof theory and attempts unbounded symbolic loop execution. I’m stopping that diagnostic, retaining its log as such, and rerunning the entry with its required `SPEC.filter-loop` dependency kept; the loop itself already closed independently.
